<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Galatifoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paulo Nwoma A Ɔtwerɛ Kɔmaa Galatifoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatifoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Paulo Nwoma A</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔtwerɛ Kɔmaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Galatifoɔ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkyea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Me Paulo, ɔsomafoɔ a ɛnyɛ nnipa anaa onipa bi na ɔfrɛɛ me, na mmom ɛyɛ Yesu Kristo ne Agya Onyankopɔn a ɔnyanee no firii awufoɔ mu no. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Me ne anuanom a wɔne me wɔ ha nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 1:2"/>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">De krataa yi kɔma Galati asafo ahodoɔ no nyinaa:<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Adom ne asomdwoeɛ a ɛfiri yɛn Agya Onyankopɔn ne Awurade Yesu Kristo nka mo. <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Yɛn bɔne enti, Kristo yɛɛ ɔsetie maa yɛn Agya Onyankopɔn. Ɔnam so de ne ho bɔɔ afɔdeɛ de gyee yɛn firii bɔne a yɛwɔ mu ɛnnɛ yi mu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Animuonyam nka Onyankopɔn daa nyinaa. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Mo ho yɛ me nwanwa! Ɛnkyɛree koraa, morepa deɛ ɔnam Kristo adom so frɛɛ mo no akɔ asɛmpa foforɔ ho. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Nokorɛm, asɛmpa foforɔ biara nni baabi, nanso meka ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa bi wɔ hɔ a wɔredane mo adwene pɛ sɛ wɔsesa Kristo Asɛmpa no. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Na sɛ yɛn, anaa ɔbɔfoɔ firi ɔsoro bɛka asɛmpa a nsonsonoeɛ da ɛno ne yɛn Asɛmpa no ntam a, onii no bɛkɔ afɔbuo a ɛnni awieeɛ mu. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Yɛaka dada na mereti mu bio sɛ: Obiara a ɔbɛka asɛmpa a ɛne Asɛmpa a moagye atom no bɔ abira no bɛkɔ afɔbuo a ɛnni awieeɛ mu.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Deɛ nnipa pene so na mereyɛ yi anaa? Dabi! Mepɛ deɛ Onyankopɔn pene so! Anaa mereyɛ deɛ ɛsɔ nnipa ani? Sɛ megu so yɛ saa deɛ a, na menyɛ Kristo ɔsomfoɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Frɛ Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Anuanom, mepɛ sɛ mote aseɛ sɛ, Asɛmpa a meka kyerɛ mo no mfiri onipa hɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Me nsa anka amfiri onipa nkyɛn. Saa ara nso na ɛnyɛ onipa na ɔkyerɛɛ me. Ɛyɛ Kristo no ankasa na ɔdaa no adi kyerɛɛ me.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Moate sɛ na mesɛe mʼadagyeɛ nyinaa wɔ Yudasom ho. Afei, moate nso sɛ na mede atirimuɔden taa Onyankopɔn akyidifoɔ, na mefaa ɛkwan biara a mɛtumi so pɛɛ sɛ metɔre wɔn ase. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Mʼafɛfoɔ Yudafoɔ no deɛ, na mʼadwene mu abue wɔ Yudasom ho sene wɔn nyinaa. Na mekura yɛn nananom amanneɛ nso mu dendeenden. <verse eid="GAL 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn nam nʼadom so frɛɛ me ansa na wɔrewo me sɛ memmɛsom no. Na berɛ no soo <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>sɛ ɔbɛda ne Ba no adi akyerɛ me, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mɛka Asɛmpa a ɛfa ne ho akyerɛ amanamanmufoɔ no, mankɔ obiara nkyɛn amma wantu me fo; <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>saa ara nso na mankɔ Yerusalem mankɔhunu asomafoɔ a na wɔdi mʼanim ɛkan no. Mmom, mekɔɔ Arabia prɛko pɛ ɛnna mesane mʼakyi baa Damasko.<verse eid="GAL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Mfeɛ mmiɛnsa akyi na mekɔɔ Petro nkyɛn wɔ Yerusalem ne no kɔdii nkɔmmɔ. Medii ne nkyɛn dadu nnanum. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Manhunu ɔsomafoɔ biara wɔ hɔ ka Awurade nua Yakobo ho. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Meka kyerɛ mo, Onyankopɔn anim sɛ deɛ meretwerɛ yi yɛ nokorɛ trodoo.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Ɛno akyi, mebaa Siria ne Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Kristo asafo ahodoɔ a wɔwɔ Yudea no mu nnipa nnim me. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Nsɛm a na wɔaka afa me ho sɛ, “Afei deɛ, ɔbarima no a na ɔtaa yɛn no ka gyidie a na ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsɛe no no ho asɛm.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Na me enti, wɔhyɛɛ Onyankopɔn animuonyam.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Ne Asomafoɔ A Aka No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Mfeɛ dunan akyi, me ne Barnaba sane kɔɔ Yerusalem. Mede Tito nso kaa me ho. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Mekɔeɛ ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn na ɔdaa no adi kyerɛɛ me sɛ menkɔ. Me ne mpanimfoɔ no yɛɛ nhyiamu kɔkoam kyerɛkyerɛɛ asɛmpa a meka mekyerɛɛ amanamanmufoɔ no mu kyerɛɛ wɔn. Na mempɛ sɛ mʼadwuma a mayɛ dada ne deɛ megu so reyɛ no yɛ ɔkwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Ɛwom sɛ me ɔboafoɔ Tito yɛ Helani deɛ, nanso wɔanhyɛ no sɛ ɔntwa twetia. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Asɛm yi siiɛ, ɛfiri sɛ anuanom bi a wɔnyɛ nokwafoɔ awia wɔn ho abɛfra yɛn mu a wɔrehwehwɛ ahofadie a yɛwɔ wɔ Kristo Yesu mu, na wɔde yɛn ayɛ nkoa. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Yɛamma wɔn mu kwan koraa, sɛdeɛ nokorɛ a ɛwɔ Asɛmpa no mu no bɛtena mo mu.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Wɔn a wɔfa wɔn ho sɛ wɔyɛ atitire no, sɛdeɛ wɔte biara no, meka sɛ, menhunu wɔn ntam nsonsonoeɛ biara. Onyankopɔn nhwɛ nnipa ho mmu atɛn; saa mpanimfoɔ no mfaa adwene foforɔ biara mmɛkaa mʼasɛm no ho. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Na mmom, wɔhunuu sɛ Onyankopɔn de dwuma no ahyɛ me nsa sɛ menka Asɛmpa no nkyerɛ amanamanmufoɔ sɛdeɛ ɔde dwuma no hyɛɛ Petro nsa sɛ ɔnka Asɛmpa no nkyerɛ Yudafoɔ no ara pɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Na Onyankopɔn a ɔnam Petro so yɛ adwuma sɛ Yudafoɔ mu somafoɔ no ara na ɔnam me so yɛ adwuma wɔ amanamanmufoɔ mu sɛdeɛ Petro yɛ Yudafoɔ mu adwuma no pɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Yakobo, Petro ne Yohane a na wɔfa no sɛ wɔyɛ mpanimfoɔ no gye too mu sɛ, Onyankopɔn ama me dwuma sononko bi sɛ menyɛ, enti wɔkyeaa me ne Barnaba. Wɔpenee so sɛ yɛnyɛ adwuma wɔ amanamanmufoɔ no mu na wɔn nso wɔnyɛ adwuma wɔ Yudafoɔ no mu. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Wɔbisaa sɛ yɛnkae ahiafoɔ wɔ wɔn kuo no mu sɛdeɛ mepɛ sɛ meyɛ no.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Ɛberɛ a Petro baa Antiokia no, metiaa deɛ ɔreyɛ no mu wɔ badwa mu, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔreyɛ mfomsoɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Ansa na mmarima bi a Yakobo somaa wɔn no bɛduruu hɔ no, na Petro ne anuanom amanamanmufoɔ no to nsa didi. Nanso, nnipa no bɛduruiɛ akyi no, ɔtwee ne ho a ɔne wɔn annidi bio, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔsuro wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔtwa amanamanmufoɔ twetia no. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Anuanom Yudafoɔ a aka no yɛɛ sɛ ahufoɔ de wɔn ho bɔɔ Petro maa Barnaba nso de ne ho kɔbataa wɔn ho.<verse eid="GAL 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Mehunuu sɛ deɛ wɔreyɛ no ne Asɛmpa no bɔ abira no, mekaa no wɔ Petro ne badwa no anim sɛ, “Woyɛ Yudani a seesei wonni Yudafoɔ amanneɛ so bio. Adɛn enti na wohyɛ amanamanmufoɔ sɛ wɔnni Yudafoɔ amanneɛ so?<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>“Ɛyɛ nokorɛ sɛ yɛyɛ Yudafoɔ firi yɛn awoɔ mu. Yɛnyɛ amanamanmufoɔ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ no. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Yɛnim sɛ ansa na obi bɛdi bem wɔ Onyankopɔn anim no, na gye sɛ wagye Yesu Kristo adi a ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔbɛyɛ deɛ mmara no hwehwɛ sɛ ɔnyɛ no. Yɛn nso, yɛagye Kristo Yesu adi sɛdeɛ yɛnam so bɛdi bem wɔ Onyankopɔn anim; ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnam gyidie so na wɔbɛbu yɛn bem, na ɛnyɛ mmara no apɛdeɛ a yɛyɛ no so.<verse eid="GAL 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>“Sɛ yɛpɛ sɛ wɔbu yɛn bem wɔ Kristo mu na sɛ ɛda adi sɛ yɛn nso yɛyɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ Kristo pene bɔne so? Ɛnte saa koraa. <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Na sɛ mehyɛ aseɛ yɛ deɛ magyae a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ meyɛ mmaratofoɔ.<verse eid="GAL 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>“Ɛfiri sɛ, mpɛn dodoɔ a mepɛɛ sɛ mɛdi mmara no so no, mmara no buu me fɔ. Mmara no ankasa akum me. Ɛno enti, menni mmara no tumi ase bio, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mɛtena ase mama Onyankopɔn mmom. Wɔabɔ me ne Kristo asɛnnua mu, <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>enti ɛnyɛ me na mete ase bio, na mmom, Kristo no na ɔte me mu. Saa asetena a mete mu seesei yi, mete ase wɔ Onyankopɔn Ba no a ɔdɔ me na ɔde ne nkwa maa me no gyidie mu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Mempo Onyankopɔn adom no. Sɛ onipa nam Mmara so fata Onyankopɔn anim a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ Kristo wu a ɔwuiɛ no yɛ ɔkwa.”<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Gyidie Anaa Mmara So Di</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Mo Galatifoɔ adwenemherɛfoɔ! Hwan na ɔdanee mo adwene saa? Mo ara mo anim na wɔkyerɛɛ mu pefee sɛ wɔbɔɔ Yesu Kristo asɛnnua mu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Mommua me saa asɛm yi: Moyɛɛ deɛ Mmara no hwehwɛ sɛ monyɛ ansa na Onyankopɔn Honhom no reba mo so? Anaasɛ motiee Asɛmpa no gye diiɛ ansa? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Saa na mo adwene mu yɛ herɛ? Mode Onyankopɔn Honhom firii aseɛ; afei mopɛ sɛ mode mo ara mo tumi wie? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Mo suahunu yi nyinaa ho amma mfasoɔ biara? Mennye nni saa. <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Onyankopɔn nam mmara no so na ɔde ne Honhom no maa mo anaa? Anaasɛ ɔnam mmara no so na ɔyɛɛ anwanwadeɛ wɔ mo mu anaa? Ɛnyɛ asɛm no gye a mogye diiɛ nti? <verse eid="GAL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Atwerɛsɛm no kaa Abraham ho asɛm sɛ, “Ɔgyee Onyankopɔn diiɛ na ɛsiane ne gyidie enti, Onyankopɔn gyee no sɛ onipa tenenee.”<verse eid="GAL 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Enti ɛsɛ sɛ mote aseɛ sɛ, nnipa a wɔwɔ gyidie no na wɔyɛ Abraham asefoɔ turodoo. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Atwerɛsɛm no dii ɛkan hunuu sɛ Onyankopɔn nam gyidie so bɛbu amanamanmufoɔ no bem. Yei enti, Atwerɛsɛm no dii ɛkan kaa Asɛmpa no kyerɛɛ Abraham sɛ, “Ɛnam wo so na Onyankopɔn bɛhyira nnipa a wɔwɔ asase so nyinaa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Abraham gye diiɛ, na wɔhyiraa no, na wɔn a wɔgye di nyinaa nso, wɔahyira wɔn sɛdeɛ wɔhyiraa no no.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Wɔadome obiara a ɔde ne ho bɛto ne nnwuma a ɛfiri mmara no mu so. Ɛfiri sɛ wɔatwerɛ sɛ, “Wɔadome obiara a wankɔ so anni deɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ Mmara Nwoma mu no nyinaa so.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Afei, akyinnyeɛ biara nni ho sɛ obiara rentumi mfa mmara no so die nsɔ Onyankopɔn ani. Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, “Ɛnam gyidie so na ɔteneneeni bɛnya nkwa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Mmara no nnyinasoɔ nnyɛ gyidie; ɛfiri sɛ, wɔatwerɛ sɛ, deɛ ɔdi mmara no so bɛnya nkwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Ɛno enti na Kristo agye yɛn afiri nnome a Mmara no de brɛɛ yɛn no mu. Wayɛ nnome ama yɛn sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, “Obiara a wɔbɛsɛn no dua so no hyɛ Onyankopɔn nnome ase.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Kristo gyee yɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, nhyira a wɔhyiraa Abraham no nam Kristo so bɛba amanamanmufoɔ so, na yɛnam gyidie so anya Honhom a wɔhyɛɛ yɛn ho bɔ no.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Ne Bɔhyɛ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Anuanom, mede yɛn asetena mu asɛm bi bɛyɛ nhwɛsoɔ: Sɛ nnipa baanu bi pene asɛm bi so na wɔyɛ ho apam a, obiara rentumi mmu apam no so na wɔrentumi mfa biribi nka ho. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ Abraham ne nʼaseni bɔ. Atwerɛsɛm no nnka sɛ, “Wo ne wʼasefoɔ” a ɛkyerɛ nnipa bebree. Ɛka sɛ, “Wo ne wʼaseni” a ɛkyerɛ sɛ onipa baako a ɔno ne Kristo no. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Mekyerɛ sɛ: Onyankopɔn yɛɛ apam na ɔhyɛɛ bɔ sɛ ɔbɛdi so. Mmara no a ɛbaa akyire no ntumi nsesa anaa ɛrentumi ntwa bɔ a Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ mfirinhyia ahanan ne aduasa ansa na ɔde Mmara no maaeɛ, no mu. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Na sɛ nhyira a Onyankopɔn de maaeɛ no gyina Mmara so a, ɛnneɛ na ɛnyɛ bɔhyɛ bio. Nanso Onyankopɔn firi nʼadom mu, nam bɔhyɛ so de agyapadeɛ no maa Abraham.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Ɛnneɛ na Mmara no ho mfasoɔ ne sɛn? Wɔde maa akyire no de kyerɛɛ sɛ yɛyɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ kɔsi sɛ Aseni no a wɔhyɛɛ ne ho bɔ no bɛba. Abɔfoɔ no na wɔde Mmara no maa Mose, na ɔno nso yɛɛ Onyankopɔn ne nnipa no ntamgyinafoɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Yɛnim sɛ ntamgyinafoɔ ho hia ma nnipa baanu anaa deɛ ɛboro saa, nanso Onyankopɔn a ɔyɛ baako amfa ntamugyinafoɔ ɛberɛ a ɔhyɛɛ Abraham bɔ no.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara No Botaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Yei kyerɛ sɛ Mmara no tia Onyankopɔn bɔhyɛ no anaa? Dabi! Sɛ mmara bi wɔ hɔ a ɛtumi ma nnipa nkwa a, ɛnneɛ anka onipa nam saa mmara no so bɛtumi atene wɔ Onyankopɔn anim. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Nanso, Atwerɛsɛm no aka sɛ, ewiase nyinaa hyɛ bɔne tumi ase. Ɛno enti, akyɛdeɛ a wɔhyɛɛ ho bɔ no, wɔnam Yesu Kristo so nko ara de bɛma wɔn a wɔgye di no.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Ansa na gyidie no reba no, Mmara no too yɛn mpɔkyerɛ kɔsii sɛ wɔbɛdaa gyidie no adi. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Enti, Mmara no na ɛhyɛɛ yɛn so kɔsii sɛ Kristo baeɛ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔnam gyidie so bɛbu yɛn bem. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Afei a berɛ aduru sɛ yɛgye Kristo di no, Mmara no nni yɛn so tumi bio.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Ɛnam gyidie so enti na mo nyinaa yɛ Onyankopɔn mma a mo ne Kristo Yesu aka abom no. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Wɔbɔɔ mo asu hyɛɛ Kristo mu enti, moafa Kristo mu nnepa no ato mo ho so. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Yɛnni Yudani anaa Helani, yɛnni akoa anaa ɔdehyeɛ, yɛnni ɔbarima anaa ɔbaa, na mo nyinaa yɛ onipa korɔ wɔ Kristo Yesu mu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Enti sɛ moyɛ Kristo dea a, na moyɛ Abraham asefoɔ, na bɔhyɛ no enti, moyɛ adedifoɔ nso.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Asɛm a mereka ne sɛ, mpɛn dodoɔ a ɔdedifoɔ no yɛ abɔfra no, ɛwom sɛ agyapadeɛ no nyinaa hyɛ ne nsa deɛ, nanso nsonsonoeɛ biara nna ɔno ne akoa ntam. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Esiane sɛ ɔnnyiniiɛ no enti, nnipa bi wɔ hɔ a wɔhwɛ toto nneɛma ma no kɔsi ɛberɛ a nʼagya ahyɛ sɛ wɔnnane agyapadeɛ no mma no no.<verse eid="GAL 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Tɔɔ Ahofadie Maa Yɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Saa ara na na yɛn nso yɛteɛ. Na yɛte sɛ mmɔfra a ewiase ahonhom dii yɛn so. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Nanso, mmerɛ pa no duruiɛ no, Onyankopɔn somaa ne Ba a ɔbaa woo no Mmara ase <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>sɛ ɔmmɛgye wɔn a wɔhyɛ Mmara ase sɛdeɛ wɔbɛyɛ Onyankopɔn mma. <verse eid="GAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Esiane sɛ moyɛ mma enti, Onyankopɔn somaa ne Ba no Honhom baa yɛn akoma mu, Honhom a ɛfrɛ “Agya, Agya.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Enti, wonyɛ akoa bio, na mmom woyɛ ɔba. Esiane sɛ woyɛ ne ba enti, Onyankopɔn de deɛ ɔwɔ nyinaa bɛma ne mma.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galatifoɔ Ho Hia Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Mmerɛ bi a atwam no, na monnim Onyankopɔn, enti na moyɛ nkoa ma wɔn a wɔnyɛ anyame. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Nanso, afei a moahunu Onyankopɔn anaasɛ Onyankopɔn ahunu mo yi, adɛn enti na mopɛ sɛ modane mo ho ma nkyerɛkyerɛ a aba nni mu no? Adɛn enti na mopɛ sɛ wɔde mo yɛ nkoa bio? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Modi nna, abosome, nnapɔnna ne mfeɛ bi. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Mesuro sɛ, ɛkwan bi so, masɛe mʼahoɔden wɔ mo ho.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Mesrɛ mo, me nuanom, monyɛ sɛ me, ɛfiri sɛ meyɛɛ sɛ mo. Monyɛɛ me bɔne biara. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Sɛdeɛ monim no, ɛberɛ a mebɛkaa Asɛmpa no kyerɛɛ mo no, mede yadeɛ na ɛbaeɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Ɛwom sɛ na me yadeɛ no ha mo deɛ, nanso moampo me. Mmom, mogyee me sɛdeɛ mobɛgye Onyankopɔn ɔbɔfoɔ; mogyee me sɛdeɛ mobɛgye Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Anigyeɛ a mowɔ no nyinaa afa he? Mɛtumi aka sɛ, sɛ mobɛtumi a, anka mobɛtutu mo ani de ama me. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Nokorɛ a meka kyerɛ mo enti na afei mabɛyɛ mo ɔtamfoɔ yi?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Saa nnipa no pɛ sɛ wɔtwe mo ba wɔn nkyɛn, nanso wɔnni adwene pa. Wɔhwehwɛ sɛ wɔbɛtete me ne mo ntam na ama mo ani aku wɔn ho sɛdeɛ wɔn ani ku mo ho no. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Ɛyɛ sɛ mobɛyɛ nsi ɛberɛ biara, ɛberɛ a mewɔ mo nkyɛn ne ɛberɛ a menni mo nkyɛn mpo. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Me mma pa, mo a mo enti merehunu awoyea bio kɔsi sɛ Kristo bɛda ne ho adi wɔ mo mu no, <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>mepɛ sɛ mewɔ mo nkyɛn, na anka masesa kwan a me fa so kasa, ɛfiri sɛ me tirim ntene me wɔ mo ho.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hagar Ne Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Monka nkyerɛ me, mo a mopɛ sɛ mohyɛ Mmara no ase no, monnim deɛ Mmara no ka no anaa? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Wɔatwerɛ sɛ, na Abraham wɔ mma baanu. Ɔne afenaa bi woo baako na ɔne ɔbaa bi a ɔde ne ho nso woo baako. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Afenaa ba no, wɔwoo no honam kwan so, ɛnna ɔbaa a ɔde ne ho no nso, Onyankopɔn bɔhyɛ enti na ɔwoo ne ba no.<verse eid="GAL 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Saa asɛm yi yɛ mfatoho ɛfiri sɛ, saa mmaa baanu yi gyina hɔ ma apam mmienu. Apam baako firi bepɔ Sinai so, na ɛgyina hɔ ma mma a wɔbɛyɛ nkoa: Ɔno ne Hagar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Hagar gyina hɔ ma bepɔ Sinai a ɛwɔ Arabia na ɛte sɛ kuropɔn Yerusalem, ɛfiri sɛ ɔne ne mma wɔ nkoasom mu. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Nanso, Yerusalem a ɛwɔ ɔsoro no deɛ, ɛde ne ho na ɔyɛ yɛn maame. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Ɛfiri sɛ wɔatwerɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Ao ɔbaa a woyɛ obonini, di ahurisie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">wo a wonnwoo da;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">ma wo nne so na team,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">wo a awoɔ nkaa wo da,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">ɛfiri sɛ ɔbaa a woannya awoɔ da no mma dɔɔso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">sene deɛ ɔwɔ kunu.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Me nuanom mmaa ne mmarima, bɔhyɛ no enti na wɔwoo mo sɛdeɛ wɔwoo Isak no. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na ɔba a wɔnam honam kwan so woo no no taa deɛ wɔnam Honhom no tumi mu woo no no. Na ɛnnɛ yi nso, ɛte saa. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Na Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛn? “Pam afenaa no ne ne babarima yi firi ha; ɛfiri sɛ, afenaa babarima no ne ɔdehyeɛ no renkyɛ agyapadeɛ no.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Enti, anuanom, yɛnyɛ afenaa no mma, na mmom, yɛyɛ ɔbaa a ɔde ne ho no mma.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ahofadie Wɔ Kristo Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Ahofadie enti na Kristo ama yɛade yɛn ho no. Monnyina pintinn. Mommma ho ɛkwan mma wɔmmfa mo nnyɛ nkoa bio.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Montie! Me Paulo, meka mekyerɛ mo sɛ, sɛ moma ho ɛkwan ma wɔtwa mo twetia a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ Kristo ho amma mfasoɔ biara amma mo koraa. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Mebɔ mo kɔkɔ bio sɛ obiara a ɔbɛma ho ɛkwan ama wɔatwa no twetia no, na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔdi Mmara no nyinaa so. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Mo a mopɛ sɛ wɔde Mmara no bu mo bem no ate mo ho afiri Kristo ho. Adom no nni mo so bio. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Nanso yɛfiri gyidie mu nam Honhom no so twɛne tenenee a yɛn ani da soɔ no. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Kristo Yesu mu no, twetiatwa ne momonotoyɛ ho nni mfasoɔ. Deɛ ɛho hia ne gyidie a ɛnam ɔdɔ so da ne ho adi.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Na anka moresi mmirikakan no yie! Na hwan na ɔtwintwanee mo anan mu ma mogyaee nokorɛ no tie? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Saa nnaadaa no mfiri deɛ ɔfrɛ mo no. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>“Mmɔka kakra bi na ɛma mmɔre no nyinaa tu.” <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Mewɔ anidasoɔ wɔ Awurade mu sɛ morennwene adwene foforɔ bi. Onipa ko a ɔde sakasakayɛ reba mo mu no, wɔbɛtua ne so ka. <verse eid="GAL 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Anuanom, sɛ megu so ka twetiatwa ho asɛm a, adɛn enti na wɔda so taa me? Na sɛ ɛno na ɛyɛ nokorɛ a, anka mʼasɛm a meka fa Kristo asɛnnua ho no renkɔfa ɔhaw mma. Ɛnneɛ na anka asɛnnua no ho suntidua biara nni hɔ bio. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Sɛ ɛkaa me nko a, anka wɔn a wɔha mo no atwa wɔn ho atwitwa wɔn ho wɔn ho.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Me nuanom, mo deɛ, wɔfrɛɛ mo sɛ mommɛde mo ho. Nanso, mommma saa ahofadie yi mmɔ ɛkwan mma bɔne; mmom, momfa ɔdɔ nsom mo ho mo ho. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Mmara no nyinaa tiawatwa ne sɛ, “Dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Na sɛ mokeka na momemene mo ho mo ho a, ɛnneɛ monhwɛ yie na moansɛe mo ho mo ho.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Honhom Mu Asetena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Na mese, montena ase wɔ Honhom mu, na moremma honam akɔnnɔ ho kwan. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ honam pɛ no tia deɛ Honhom no pɛ; saa ara nso na deɛ Honhom no pɛ no, honam no tia. Ne mmienu no bɔ abira, enti ɛnsɛ sɛ moyɛ deɛ mopɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Sɛ mo nante Honhom mu a, na monnhyɛ Mmara ase.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Dwuma a bɔnesu di no da adi pefee. Yeinom ne adwamammɔ, efi, ahohwie, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>abosonsom, adutoɔ, ɔtan, akayɛ, ahoɔyea, abufuo, apereapereɛ, kunsunkunsun, mpaapaemu, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>nitan, nsãborɔ, agobɔne, ne nneɛma a ɛtete saa. Mebɔ mo kɔkɔ sɛdeɛ mabɔ mo bi dada no sɛ, wɔn a wɔtena ase saa no renkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Na Honhom no aba ne ɔdɔ, anigyeɛ, asomdwoeɛ, abodwokyɛreɛ, ayamyɛ, papayɛ, gyidie, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>ɔdwoɔ ne ahohyɛsoɔ. Mmara biara nni hɔ a ɛtia yeinom. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Na wɔn a wɔyɛ Kristo dea no abɔ wɔn nipasu no ne honam akɔnnɔ asɛnnua mu. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Sɛ yɛte Honhom mu yi, momma yɛnnante Honhom mu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛhoahoa yɛn ho, yiyi yɛn ho yɛn ho abufuo, anaa yɛma yɛn ani bere yɛn ho yɛn ho.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Papayɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Anuanom, sɛ obi kɔtɔ bɔne mu a, ɛsɛ sɛ mo a moyɛ honhom mufoɔ no fa ɔdwoɔ ɛkwan so tene no. Nanso, monhwɛ wie na mo nso wɔansɔ mo anhwɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Monsoa mo ho mo ho nnesoa. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, modi Kristo mmara no so. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Sɛ obi dwene sɛ ɔyɛ otitire a ɛnso ɔnsɛ hwee a, na ɔdaadaa ne ho. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Yɛ wʼadwuma yie na woanya biribi agyina so de ahoahoa wo ho. Na mfa wo ho ntoto afoforɔ ho; <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ obiara soa nʼadesoa. <verse eid="GAL 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Wone deɛ ɔkyerɛkyerɛ wo Onyankopɔn Asɛm no nkyɛ adepa biara a wowɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Monnnaadaa mo ho; obiara rentumi nsi Onyankopɔn atwetweɛ. Deɛ onipa dua no, ɛno ara na ɔtwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Sɛ modi mo akɔnnɔ bɔne akyi a, mobɛkɔ ɔsɛeɛ mu, nanso sɛ monante Honhom mu a, mobɛnya daa nkwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Ne saa enti, mommma yɛmmmrɛ papayɛ ho, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu no, sɛ yɛampa aba a yɛbɛtwa nnɔbaeɛ no. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Enti, mmerɛ dodoɔ a yɛwɔ akwannya no, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ obiara papa, ne titire no, wɔn a yɛne wɔn bɔ agyidifoɔ abusua.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyɛ Twetiatwa Na Mmom Abɔdeɛ Foforɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Monhwɛ atwerɛ akɛseɛ a mede mʼankasa me nsa matwerɛ abrɛ mo.<verse eid="GAL 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔhoahoa wɔn ho no ara na wɔpɛ sɛ wɔhyɛ mo ma motwitwa twetia. Deɛ enti a wɔyɛ yei ne sɛ, wɔmpɛ sɛ Kristo asɛnnua no enti wɔtaa wɔn. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Wɔn a wɔtwa twetia no mpo nni Mmara no so. Pɛ ara na wɔpɛ sɛ wɔtwa mo twetia sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛtumi de mo ahoahoa wɔn ho sɛ wɔn akyidifoɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Nanso, me deɛ, Awurade Yesu Kristo asɛnnua no nko ara na mede bɛhoahoa me ho; nʼasɛnnua no enti, deɛ mede hoahoa me ho wɔ ewiase no awu, na saa ara na deɛ ewiase de hoahoa ne ho wɔ me mu no nso awu. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Sɛ obi atwa twetia anaa ɔntwaa twetia no nka hwee. Deɛ ɛho hia ne abɔdeɛ foforɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Onyankopɔn adɔeɛ ne nʼasomdwoeɛ nka wɔn a wɔdi saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi so nyinaa; wɔn ne Onyankopɔn mu nnipa foforɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Deɛ ɛtwa toɔ, obiara nha mʼadwene bio, ɛfiri sɛ, mewɔ ɔhonam ani etwã a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, meyɛ Yesu dea.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Me nuanom, Awurade Yesu Kristo adom no nka mo nyinaa. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
